# African Nations League Web Application

This project is a web application built using **Angular** and a **NoSQL database** (Firebase / MongoDB).  
It allows federations to register, manage their teams, and participate in the African Nations League tournament.

---

## 🧩 Technologies Used
- **Frontend:** Angular
- **Backend:** Node.js + Express (or Firebase if applicable)
- **Database:** MongoDB Atlas / Firebase Firestore
- **Language:** TypeScript / JavaScript
- **Package Manager:** npm install                             
ng serve
